{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10127060","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10127060","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1012706001:0":{"text":"私たちが……勝った？","source_cn":"我们……是不是赢了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88F3CE1A6F7B4FC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012706002:0":{"text":"少なくとも、どこにもイミルの気配は感じられない。","source_cn":"起码，我已经彻底感受不到伊米尔的气息了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x435AE49BE9FBEB06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012706003:0":{"text":"バカな男だよ。結局ミサタ様の制裁からは逃れられなかったね。","source_cn":"愚蠢的男人，最终还是没能逃过弥萨忒的制裁。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23E7C0D6AE6D5FFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1012706004:0":{"text":"イミルに奪われた生命力はすべてフォレストエッグが吸収した。卵を流光の樹のもとへ持っていけば、力も樹に帰るじゃろう。","source_cn":"伊米尔夺走的生命力已经被翡绿之卵尽数吸收。只要把翡绿之...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA5FDC989CEEEB53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012706005:0":{"text":"子供たちよ、すべて終わったのじゃ。","source_cn":"孩子们，都结束了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE70B279B5D0312C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_ti